voynich-transcription-mismatch: license

Dataset: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0)
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

  VCAT's comparison (the verdicts, statuses and similarity scores) is
  CC-BY-4.0. The text of the rows is read from the Zandbergen-Landini (ZL) and
  Takahashi (IT) transliterations, and the rows record whether CD, FG and GC
  hold each locus (none of their text). voynich.nu makes all five
  transliterations available under CC0 (CC0-1.0); the statement was read at
  its source on 2026-10-17 and is recorded in data_sources/sources.yaml and
  docs/SOURCES_LICENSE.md of the repository.

  Please cite the transliterators named in the dataset card in published work.

Code that builds the data: MIT License
  https://github.com/noah-chelednik/voynich-data/blob/main/LICENSE

The manuscript itself is in the public domain.
